== What are Errlogs ? ==
On a PS5, an '''EMC ERRLOG''' refers to a '''error log''' generated by the system’s '''Embedded Multi-Chip (EMC) controller''', which manages memory, power, and communication between hardware components. These logs record hardware or firmware issues such as power fluctuations, memory faults, or communication errors. These errors ccan then help identify issues with the console more easliy and fix them.

In order to get these logs follow this guide [[PlayStation 5 Fault Finding Using UART]]

